#. module: stock_picking_extras
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_picking_extras.field_stock_picking__total_packages
msgid ""
"This field displays the total count of unique packages associated with the "
"moves in this transfer. It is automatically computed based on the "
"'Destination Package' set on the detailed operations."
msgstr ""
"Este campo muestra el conteo total de paquetes únicos asociados con los "
"movimientos en esta transferencia. Se calcula automáticamente basado en "
"el 'Paquete de Destino' establecido en las operaciones detalladas."

#. module: stock_picking_extras
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_picking_extras.field_stock_picking__total_bundles
msgid ""
"Represents the total number of handling units (bundles) for logistics. "
"Calculation Rule: Each unique Package counts as 1 Bundle. For items not in a "
"package (loose), each unit of product quantity counts as 1 Bundle."
msgstr ""
"Representa el número total de unidades de manejo (bultos) para logística. "
"Regla de Cálculo: Cada Paquete único cuenta como 1 Bulto. Para artículos "
"sin paquete (sueltos), cada unidad de cantidad de producto cuenta como 1 Bulto."

#. module: stock_picking_extras
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:stock_picking_extras.field_stock_picking__total_packages
msgid "Total Packages"
msgstr "Total Paquetes"

#. module: stock_picking_extras
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:stock_picking_extras.field_stock_picking__total_bundles
msgid "Total Bundles"
msgstr "Total Bultos"

